&lt;li&gt;Fix doc typo for &lt;code&gt;symbolic_multi_out&lt;/code&gt; (#160702)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;onnx.md&lt;/code&gt; to simplify deprecated entities (#159312)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update export docstring and set &lt;code&gt;fallback=False&lt;/code&gt; by default (#162622, #162726)&lt;/li&gt;
