&lt;li&gt;Stop suggesting to use &lt;code&gt;guard_size_oblivious&lt;/code&gt; on data dependent errors (#160510)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avoid unnecessary slices resulting in data-dependent errors (#157528)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Quantization&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revamp dtype documentation (#156087)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use new type statement to fix public API of types (#158487)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
