&lt;li&gt;Support parallel reduction for GroupNorm in Inductor CPU backend (#144020).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add support for online softmax. Online softmax uses a customized reduction to compute max and sum at the same time by accessing the data in one pass (#127011).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add ROCm specific matmul tuning parameters (#148437).&lt;/li&gt;
